sources.prompt:
Generate a photorealistic premium editorial contact sheet on one perfectly square 1:1 canvas. EXACTLY 16 equal square photographs in a precise 4-column × 4-row grid, edge-to-edge, no gaps/gutters/borders/grid lines, no panel overlaps, no text, no letters, no readable tags, no logos, no watermark. Each cell must be its own distinct square crop with breathing room. Every product shown across all 16 panels is exclusively Beanies: a soft knitted winter beanie with a ribbed cuff and rounded crown, unmistakably yarn-knit with visible loops; no bill, no visor, no structured cap panels Never mix in or show any other hat style, sock, clothing item or unrelated product. Product materials/details: soft rib-knit cotton-wool blend beanie with folded cuff, navy, oatmeal cream and muted slate blue yarn; visible knit loops. Soft daylight, warm cream and pale gray-blue surfaces, restrained navy/cream/slate palette, accurate tactile fabric, natural shadows, polished real commercial product photography.

Exact row-major panel order; all 16 scenes must differ and fit fully inside their own square:
1 complete Beanies product, clean construction overview;
2 macro brand-craft detail of this exact product: macro of ribbed knit loops, crown shaping and folded cuff construction, with only a tiny unmarked generic geometric stitch if any;
3 top-down product brief tabletop with this product, matching material swatches and blank cards;
4 hands measuring its key fit dimensions: measure the beanie circumference and height from lower cuff to crown;
5 hands carefully sampling this product: hands gently stretch the rib-knit beanie cuff and feel the knitted fabric;
6 close quality inspection of its actual seams and workmanship, no other garment;
7 hands neatly packing this product in clean tissue;
8 this product presented in an open premium cream box;
9 this product inside a clear protective bag;
10 this product beside an unmarked kraft mailer;
11 a blank hangtag/insert beside this product, absolutely no writing;
12 refined generic brand-style still life of this product and its material, with no real or legible brand;
13 tasteful retail shelf showing display several rib-knit cuffed beanies only, with unmistakable knitted texture and no brim;
14 coordinated colorway still life: coordinated navy, oatmeal-cream and slate-blue rib-knit cuffed beanies only;
15 clean high-end ecommerce hero photograph of the complete product alone on warm off-white;
16 complementary ecommerce view of the same exact product on pale gray-blue.

Grid alignment is precise; each quadrant-sized panel has one clear photographic subject. Protect the defining silhouette in every applicable cell: a soft knitted winter beanie with a ribbed cuff and rounded crown, unmistakably yarn-knit with visible loops; no bill, no visor, no structured cap panels No human face or full person; hands may appear only where specified. Avoid medical/sport-performance claims and avoid decorative text.
